{"book":"ezekiel","num":12,"verses":[{"en":"The word of the LORD also came unto me, saying,","n":1,"sm":"Papelonia Ua oo mai foi le afioga a le ALII ia te au, ua faapea mai,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Papelonia"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"afioga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"}]},{"en":"Son of man, thou dwellest in the midst of a rebellious house, which have eyes to see, and see not; they have ears to hear, and hear not: for they are a rebellious house.","n":2,"sm":"Le atalii e o le tagata, o loo e nofo i le aiga fouvale ua ia te i latou mata e vaai, a ua latou le vaai ai; ua ia te i latou taliga e faalogo, a ua latou le faalogo ai; auā o le aiga fouvale lava i latou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aiga"},{"en":"","sm":"fouvale"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"mata"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"vaai,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vaai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"taliga"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faalogo,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faalogo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"auā"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aiga"},{"en":"","sm":"fouvale"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou."}]},{"en":"Therefore,